<title>CHINA: China '97 grain output seen above 484 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>China '97 grain output seen above 484 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's grain output is expected to be above 484 million tonnes in 1997, compared with 490 million tonnes last year, the Futures Herald newspaper said on Thursday quoting a forecast by the Ministry of Internal Trade.</p>
</text>
